# Media Viewer — Docker build context exclusions
# Context is the repo root (Dockerfile needs backend/ + Deployable/web only).
# Everything else is either runtime state, binaries, or unrelated trees.

# Runtime state — never goes into the image
# (**/ prefix: match at any depth — backend/, Deployable/, etc.)
**/.thumbnails/
**/index/
**/gotify-data/
**/*.log
**/*.log.*

# Binaries and build artifacts
**/*.exe
EOF

# Media data — always mounted, never baked
**/media/

# Unrelated workspace trees
refactor/
temp_fixes/
test-images/
tools/
data/
.playwright-mcp/
plans/

# VCS / editor / CI
.git/
.gitignore
.kilo/

# Old docker workspace (superseded by backend/Dockerfile + docker/)
Deployable/docker/

# Docs not needed for the build
**/*.md